From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peijin Zhang <peijin@ustc.edu>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 17:25:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] ContiguousMSReader: read MS columns in row blocks

Reading DATA/FLAG/WEIGHT/UVW row by row across columns thrashes the 64 KB
casacore StManArrayFile buffer when all columns share one storage manager
file. Read up to 1024 rows (16 MiB) per column with getColumnCells and
serve rows from the block. 4096^2 inversion 1.83x faster; bitwise identical
results at -j 1.

